  free half is the 0+1d free field (acid F1 itself): m_1 (corpus energy axis) =
  2 pi^2/L^2 = EXACTLY the corpus m_L (N02:73); f_1^2(b) = L^2/(2pi^2) -> inf;
  b^2-carrier f_1^2 ~ L^4(1/2pi^2+1/2pi^4) -> inf. Raw M6 remains 'not statable'
  (improper flat measure in b, no OS transfer matrix) -- the quantized completion
  (particle on a ring) is proper and violates the theorem-form trivially.
